WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
A little source. A world of motion.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.500
For the ones who build in motion.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with source. Compile scene.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Meet Trolic. The local-first vector motion language.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.500
A little source. A living canvas.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Vector. Down to the detail. Not pixels. Paths.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Motion you can read. Source to compiled motion.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Edit color. Own the timing.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Check. Export. Make it move.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Trolic. Less context. More creation.
